# App Router pages

- Always `await params` (and `searchParams` when used):
  ```tsx
  export default async function Page({
    params,
  }: {
    params: Promise<{ locale: string }>;
  }) {
    const { locale } = await params;
    // ...
  }
  ```
- Prefer Server Components; add `"use client"` only for interactivity.
- Export `generateMetadata` on pages that need distinct titles/descriptions; pull copy from messages.
- Keep routes under `src/app/[locale]/` unless adding a non-localized API route under `src/app/api/`.
- Named exports for helpers; default export only for the page/layout Next requires.
